DUAL LICENSE NOTICE
===================

This repository uses a standard open-science dual licensing structure separating
data artifacts from software/loader code:

1. DATA ARTIFACTS (`data/`, `figures/`, `croissant.json`, `DATACARD.md`):
   Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
   (CC-BY-4.0). See `LICENSE-DATA` for full terms and upstream source
   attribution requirements (CONUS Soil compilations, FRED, TRY, and Microbial
   functional gene datasets).

2. SOFTWARE & LOADER SCRIPTS (`src/`, `requirements.txt`):
   Licensed under the MIT License. See `LICENSE-CODE` for full terms.
